    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d13-a2">

                <pb facs="0261" n="251" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv09/pg251"/>

                <head>Appendix B to HD–97</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Budapest</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-11-18">November 18, 1919</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Telegram From Sir George Clerk to the
                        Supreme Council</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#flush">No. 1.</p>
                <p>Your telegram No. 12 [<hi rendition="#italic">Nov. 12?</hi>].<anchor n="9"
                        xml:id="d13-f1"/></p>
                <p>In view of the remarkable order and tranquility which has signalled withdrawal of
                    Roumanians and entry of Hungarian forces mission of <pb facs="0262" n="252"
                        xml:id="pg252"/> Generals and I agree that despatch of further allied
                    officers asked for in my telegram No. 6<anchor n="10" xml:id="d13-f2"/> is no
                    longer necessary.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
